{
  "name": "dsh-bili-lite",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "极简：给 DSH 装一个 B 站分身，让 agent 按自己规划的作息运营 B 站 —— 什么时候活跃、什么时候歇着都它自己排（schedule；没排时宿主按兑底节拍问「现在想干嘛」）；刷视频、看懂、写日记、值得的发一条评论，真喜欢就点赞 / 投币 / 关注（与主人共用账号）。写额度 / 判重 / 风控熔断 / 计划上限写死在工具里。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "bilibili",
    "agent",
    "diary"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "dist/app/plugin.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./dist/app/plugin.js",
    "./client": "./dist/features/settings/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "dist",
    "docs",
    "scripts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsc -p tsconfig.build.json && bun scripts/postbuild.ts",
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json",
    "check": "bun run typecheck && bun run build && bun scripts/check-structure.ts",
    "cli": "bun src/features/bili-agent/bili.ts"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^26.6.5",
    "typescript": "^7.0.2"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
